{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"she nods to Nolan \"come back anytime\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:33:18.391000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870720726435512381","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Oh right, I'll take my 50 in gold.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:33:29.358000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870720772434448436","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"He heads out to look for Bo","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:34:12.647000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870720954001686599","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"no no yo misunderstand.  I wont be paying for essences and then using them for you to have a specific body.  I have other experiments I use ones sold to me that are far more important.  If you want me to make you a specific form, you will give me those essences.\"\n\n\"Or you can let me get creative and get a free body\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:35:10.074000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870721194867966003","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Liz looks at Sab. \"Uh, you don't have to, its fine I guess.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:36:39.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870721568312008765","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"You can take it as money if you want.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:36:53.792000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T17:36:59.350000Z","id":"870721629892788285","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'...hmm. One rare should be enough for what I need... alright, Heore, I'll give one of the rare fiendish and my common vital for the cause, and sell you the others? Just please... if whatever you create goes berserk... please help it instead of leaving it for others to deal with.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:37:25.378000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870721762374082640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"What do you mean?\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:37:55.064000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870721886886191186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'There was this, ah, construct made of meat that went berserk nearby. We had to stop it... Heore, you know what I was like before. It was confused, in pain, not knowing what was going on, and crying out for a father that wouldn't go to deal with it himself.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:39:21.531000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870722249555066891","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'It made me realise why people wanted me dead.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:39:35.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870722306257866775","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"If it was a construct, it was not one of mine.  I make living beings\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:39:50.990000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870722373115064321","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'It was alive. That's what I mean. Alive, and in pain.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:40:24.862000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870722515184537660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"I preform services to stich people up, to improve them.  At times I further my work in creating new life.  All of the ones in my care are well taken care of to this day.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:41:42.920000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870722842583502878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'Alright. Then my conscience is at rest. I apologise for being so, ah, forceful about this issue... but you know my struggles as a corpse.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:42:41.728000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870723089242152990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"she hands Liz one rare fiendish and both the common vitals, and passes Heore the other rare fiendish and the two uncommon theurgic to sell.","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:43:05.118000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870723187346903070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Someday I will create a mind and soul, sadly the best I have done thus far is stunted at about that of a two or three year old\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:43:24.720000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-30T17:43:33.605000Z","id":"870723269563654216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"(that's 900, right?)\n'...if you can't create a mind and soul... where did I come from?' she muses to herself.","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:43:56.819000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870723404196614255","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"(yes)","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:44:12.826000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870723471334846494","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"I'll contribute these to the body then.\" (1 rare fiendish, 2 common vital)","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:45:20.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870723755587018842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"your mind and soul was already there.  I can move a brain, take the essance of one body and put it in another.  But someday I will create new life.\" she puts a hand on her stomach and looks a bit sick \"I will successfully make a person that can be my legacy.  Until then, I will keep the failures alive to see where I went wrong\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:46:13.063000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870723975645372486","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Liz goes and sits in the booth Malathor is at. (<@!470420431841656833> whenever you're available)","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:47:58.876000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870724419457257482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"a tinge of sadness in her eyes, Sabrine can't help but reach out to Heore. 'I... hope everything turns out well for you.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:50:35.617000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870725076876677171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"It will. They call me monster, but they will learn.  I will teach them.  Heore will live on in the annuls of history as the greatest scientist ever.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T17:51:51.959000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870725397078220862","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
