{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'It's easy to stay awake when you're dead. But now...'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:05:41.654000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870728877071290368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"What is your name? I feel bad calling you Miss Frog.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:05:53.358000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870728926161403925","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'Ah, Sabrine Lovlatar. I suppose you were drunk when I introduced myself. Another odd living person habit.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:06:12.908000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870729008160071680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Yes. An odd habit indeed. We poison ourselves to feel 'good' but its usually to forget something.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:06:55.890000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870729188439650345","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"she yawns and stretches, hands open before curling into a fist. 'I've only been alive for... I believe two weeks now? It's strange.'\n\nan invisible imp flies in, drops a seed into her hand as it closes, and flies out again.","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:07:15.253000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870729269653958668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
