{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Make some memories then.\"\n\"*Worked for me. I formed from her memories of me. I exist out there somewhere, probably. I don't know if the real me is dead though. I'm not magically connected to him or anything.*\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:19:19.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870732307567362049","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'Ah, are you a Guide? I have a theory that my Guide is made from my lost childhood memories... it seems to be a thing that distinguishes them from standard familiars.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:20:50.684000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870732689819443240","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'Perhaps you would be able to just... summon a body for him, Liz? I can show you the basic procedure, but a lot of what I do is likely unique to Kukudh.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:22:07.969000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870733013976231977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"*I'm not a guide. I'm the mental representation of her husband, formed into a secondary personality because she didn't want to be apart from me.*\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:23:20.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870733317920673842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Yeah, what he said.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:23:37.231000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870733388368183306","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'...ah, I apologise. This is not a situation I've ever heard of.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:23:59.975000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870733483763445820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Besides, I'm not a magic person.\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:24:09.136000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870733522187452436","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'That would be a slight technical hitch, yes. So perhaps this is your best option. Just - are you aware of the trials of the walking dead?'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:25:56.228000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870733971363856425","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'I cannot say for certain that is what you would become, I believe Heore has more skill than whoever, ah... resurrected? me, but it is a risk important to be aware of.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:26:52.965000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870734209336102953","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Well, I'll be keeping my own body.\"\n\"*And I'll be in the new one.*\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:27:22.357000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870734332615098389","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'I suppose having any body at all would be better than none.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:27:40.132000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870734407168823326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"'Just know that you may experience pain and disorientation, especially at first while you're adjusting.'","created_at":"2021-07-30T18:28:18.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870734566791458857","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
